## Acceptance

Revised at the plan gate, because the bead's stated premise was false: nothing
forces `etude gate`, so the two checks the bead called "structurally true" are in
fact the only detectors of a supervisor who skipped the model. Both seats upheld
that, and the bead text and acceptance were updated in this bead.

Against the revised text: exact line count reported; (a), (b), (d) hard and (c)
warning; the pre-push hook's 0/1/2 contract preserved; a focused test; 2481 lines
replaced; `make dogfood-audit` exits 0 on a clean tree where it failed before;
`scripts/pre-push_test.sh` unchanged at 20/20.

